			"date": "2026-11-09T20:46:56.199Z",
			"content": "<p>On one hand:<br>\n- If users are happy, then does it matter that lab's unhappy? (\"If a tree falls in a forest and no one is around...\").<br>\n- Lab being slower than real life can be a good thing to emphasis issues.<br>\n- Lab ignores faster cached visits.<br>\n- Lab only tests few pages (usually home page).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
