			},
			"date": "2026-11-09T20:46:56.200Z",
			"content": "<p>On the other hand:<br>\n- Maybe you're excluding some as you're only usable by fast users (see YouTube Project Feather)<br>\n- Field also has slow users, bit easy to ignore if aggregate us fast.<br>\n- Similarly field can hide issues for all users (like first visits being slow) if offset by others<br>\n- Field complex!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
